# Widen a live workspace and shadow a table (proposed)
// An agent adds an input schema to a live workspace, fetches the new config, then shadows a table and stops
// shadowing it. changeWorkspaceSchemas, shadowTable and unshadowTable are x-status: proposed, so this flow only
// passes in a view that includes proposed.
agent -> parent: changeWorkspaceSchemas {databases.input_schemas}
agent -> parent: getWorkspaceConfig
agent -> sidecar: shadowTable {id, to_schema, to_table_name}
agent -> sidecar: unshadowTable
